                        "string_id":  "tompson",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "It may appear after a Blowout. Or... Maybe my former colleague Doctor Thompson has it.",
                        "JA_current":  "It may appear after a Blowout. Or... Maybe my former colleague Doctor Thompson has it.",
                        "JA_new":  "エミッションの後に現れることがあります。あるいは……元同僚のトンプソン博士が持っているかもしれません。",
                        "review_notes":  null,
