                    {
                        "key":  "stable_dialogs_yantar:zombi#1",
                        "source_table":  "stable_dialogs_yantar",
                        "source_file":  "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_yantar.xml",
                        "source_xml_line":  126,
                        "string_id":  "zombi",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "Doctor Thompson came upon a controller in the underground lab nearby. The controller did not manage to subdue him completely, but many of the nervous system functions ran out of order... He has become a zombie now, but he still believes to be carrying out his research. He is a frequenter to many dangerous places, so it\u0027s quite possible that he may possess a \"Goldfish\".",
                        "JA_current":  "Doctor Thompson came upon a controller in the underground lab nearby. The controller did not manage to subdue him completely, but many of the nervous system functions ran out of order... He has become a zombie now, but he still believes to be carrying out his research. He is a frequenter to many dangerous places, so it\u0027s quite possible that he may possess a \"Goldfish\".",
                        "JA_new":  "トンプソン博士は、近くの地下研究所でコントローラーに遭遇しました。完全に支配されたわけではありませんが、神経系の機能があちこち狂ってしまって……。今ではゾンビになりましたが、本人はまだ研究を続けているつもりです。危険な場所にもよく出入りするので、«ゴールドフィッシュ»を持っている可能性は十分あります。",
                        "review_notes":  null,
                        "english_reference_status":  "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
                        "review_flags":  [

